{"about":["Off to the snow!","It does not matter if you prefer to ski, bobsleigh or sled down the ice rink, or relax curling the stones over the ice when curling - there is certainly something for everyone here.","There are six exciting disciplines to win tournaments and master challenges. You can play alone or with up to four players on the sofa - and all without a runny nose after the competition!"],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/img/cfn/11307Ni6JF24uWfff7XNMcqBrBdKe5wium9g0D1IEt9qKYr4jnhtaewto76ttWbPgeKBoQ0ZwA0t_OvSXDXwkhOKj-sz4xPr.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/img/cfn/11307Ni6JF24uWfff7XNMcqBrBdKe5wium9g0D1IEt9qKYr4jnhtaewto76ttWbPgeKBoQ0ZwA0t_OvSXDXwkhOKj-sz4xPr.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/img/cfn/11307JQEvqWN9aAwf2W8XvBHvUpGkKD6gzIR4Z1Tv3ozllos-8DDvMuL0Z9oYI0mhvn4Ka_p2ZMdEpQ_OMJOAaL8UwcfynbS.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/img/cfn/11307JQEvqWN9aAwf2W8XvBHvUpGkKD6gzIR4Z1Tv3ozllos-8DDvMuL0Z9oYI0mhvn4Ka_p2ZMdEpQ_OMJOAaL8UwcfynbS.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/img/cfn/11307LvXWi_FjMmn_UkeCUi9cNkH33IESGW0SlhgIX19uWKUGax3-_CQ6FILJiAWuH3eZf19S2xIqhFdwQiBqzHFRgwsOxI6.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/img/cfn/11307LvXWi_FjMmn_UkeCUi9cNkH33IESGW0SlhgIX19uWKUGax3-_CQ6FILJiAWuH3eZf19S2xIqhFdwQiBqzHFRgwsOxI6.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"}],"summary":"Six winter disciplines for 1 to 4 players!"}